{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# TaskBoard \u2014 Architecture\n\nUnidirectional: **intents down, snapshots up**.\nA view never mutates a task.",
      "x": -700,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "views",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Views\n`BoardScreen` \u00b7 `BoardColumnsView`\n`TaskCardView` \u00b7 `TaskListView`\n`TaskEditorSheet`\n\n**SwiftUI. Presentation only.**",
      "x": -180,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "vm",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## ViewModel\n`BoardViewModel`\n`@Observable @MainActor`\n\nOrchestrates \u2014 **does not decide**.\nOptimistic overlay \u00b7 undo \u00b7 single `write()` funnel",
      "x": -180,
      "y": -150,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "logic",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Logic \u2014 the functional core\n`BoardLogic`\n\n**PURE.** No Firebase, no SwiftUI, no clock.\nordering \u00b7 grouping \u00b7 filtering \u00b7 conflict resolution\n\n\u2192 62 tests, ~0.15s, no simulator",
      "x": -180,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "repo",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Repository\n`TaskRepository` (protocol)\n\n`snapshots()` \u00b7 `start()`\n`save(_:)` \u00b7 `clearError()`",
      "x": -180,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "fb",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### FirebaseTaskRepository\n`actor`\n\nRTDB + its **local cache as the store**.\nPersistence on \u2192 writes queue durably\nacross process death.",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "mem",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### InMemoryTaskRepository\n`actor`\n\nA **fake**, not a mock \u2014 really queues\nand replays. Latency, failure rate,\nforced offline.\n\nTests \u00b7 previews \u00b7 developer sheet",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 570,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "models",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Models\n`BoardTask` \u00b7 `TaskStatus`\n`SyncState` \u00b7 `SyncSummary` \u00b7 `SyncIssue`\n\nAll `Sendable` value types.",
      "x": -700,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "snapshot",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### RepositorySnapshot\ntasks + sync + pendingIDs\n\n**One value**, so they cannot tear \u2014\nno card reading \"synced\" while the\ntoolbar still counts it pending.",
      "x": -700,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "rules",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### database.rules.json\n\n```\nnewData.updatedAt >= data.updatedAt\n```\n\nConflict resolution **enforced server-side**.\nNot a transaction \u2014 RTDB transactions\nare not queued offline.",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 120,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "inv",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "02 Invariants.md",
      "x": 640,
      "y": -180,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
